msgctxt "7532"
msgid "Yamashiro Express"
msgstr "Corriere Yamashiro"

msgctxt "7550"
msgid "Mail Box"
msgstr "Casella di posta"

msgctxt "7559"
msgid ""
"Letters to Kiryu are delivered to this box. The box glows when a new message"
" has been delivered. Check the box from time to time for new mail. You have "
"to take a letter from the box before you can read it. Special deliveries may"
" also be made by carrier pigeon. Large packages are delivered by couriers. "
"Thank you for using Yamashiro Express!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7901"
msgid "Rikiya"
msgstr "Rikiya"

msgctxt "7908"
msgid "It's ready!"
msgstr "È pronto!"

msgctxt "7920"
msgid "The ring's ready, Aniki! <Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"
msgstr "L'anello è pronto, Aniki! <Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "7979"
msgid "The kids are all waiting, so head down to the beach ASAP!"
msgstr "I bambini stanno tutti aspettando, quindi scendi in spiaggia al più presto!"

msgctxt "8037"
msgid "Rikiya here!"
msgstr "Qui Rikiya!"

msgctxt "8050"
msgid ""
"Aniki! There's a huge building up the street! Wow, that thing's freaking "
"massive! Never seen one so big! Now I know I'm really in Tokyo! ^^"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8190"
msgid "The street I'm on has lots of stores."
msgstr "La strada in cui mi trovo ha un sacco di negozi."

msgctxt "8228"
msgid "Rikiya here!<Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Qui Rikiya!<Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "8274"
msgid "Finally found a good landmark! A convenience store!"
msgstr "Finalmente ho trovato un buon punto di riferimento! Un minimarket!"

msgctxt "8326"
msgid "I'm out in front of it now!"
msgstr "Sono proprio qua fuori!"

msgctxt "8354"
msgid "Where are you, Aniki?"
msgstr "Dove sei, Aniki?"

msgctxt "8376"
msgid "Rikiya here!<Color:1><Sign:7><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Qui Rikiya!<Color:1><Sign:7><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "8421"
msgid "Where are you, Aniki? I'm getting tired of waiting..."
msgstr "Dove sei, Aniki? Mi sto stancando di aspettare..."

msgctxt "8475"
msgid "Rikiya here!<Color:1><Sign:6><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Qui Rikiya!<Color:1><Sign:6><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "8520"
msgid "Where are you, Aniki!? You're not blowing me off, are you!?"
msgstr "Dove sei, Aniki!? Non mi starai dando buca, vero!?"

msgctxt "8580"
msgid "Great news, Aniki!"
msgstr "Grandi notizie, Aniki!"

msgctxt "8599"
msgid ""
"Forgot to tell you we cleaned out a room for you at the Ryudo Family office."
" Use it any time you want! It can be your hideout or something! You know, "
"like a place away from the kids!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8782"
msgid "Mack"
msgstr "Mack"

msgctxt "8787"
msgid "A Smack of Mack! <Color:1><Sign:48><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Un assaggio di Mack! <Color:1><Sign:48><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "8838"
msgid ""
"How's it swinging, Kiryu-san? Just wanted to fill you in on some juicy deets"
" I slurped up the other day. <Color:1><Sign:16><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8977"
msgid ""
"You know Hatsumachi, yeah? Tons of interesting-looking people roaming around"
" there, lemme tell you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9077"
msgid ""
"Speaking of, there's this old dude you might wanna try to find! Just "
"concentrate real hard once you do to take in the glory! (Word on the street "
"is, you gotta press the  "
"<Color:1><Action:Button_R3@Adventure><Color:Default> to concentrate!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9317"
msgid "Mack's Back!"
msgstr "Mack è tornato!"

msgctxt "9330"
msgid ""
"Surf's up, Kiryu-san! That's how the bros in California say hello. Anyway, "
"Japanese is kinda tough! My girlfriend's been teaching me, but I just end up"
" using all sorts of weird words. Hope you don't mind if I unleash some of my"
" practice on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9575"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'll hit you up whenever I get some sweet deets on the perfect shot."
" Stay tuned for more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9673"
msgid "Oh, and don't forget to upload your shots to a blog!"
msgstr "Oh, e non dimenticare di caricare i tuoi scatti su un blog!"

msgctxt "9726"
msgid "The Scent of Mack<Color:1><Sign:49><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Il profumo di Mack<Color:1><Sign:49><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "9777"
msgid ""
"Sorry for getting you all tied up earlier, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default> But man, you don't waste any time getting "
"what you want! <Color:1><Sign:21><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9955"
msgid ""
"By the way, my girlfriend's been hammering more and more Japanese into my "
"brainhole, so I think I'm getting pretty good! Mind if I keep practicing "
"with you? <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10145"
msgid ""
"And before I forget, I got news for you! There are rumors floating around "
"town like a pungent fart⑬some sauced up thugs have been pretending to pole "
"dance outside of Club Asia! You know, the bikini bar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10350"
msgid ""
"I hear you gotta go inside and watch the show first, then you can walk out "
"and watch another!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10444"
msgid "Mack in Action"
msgstr "Mack in azione"

msgctxt "10459"
msgid "Here I am for all your photo needs, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr "Sono a disposizione per ogni tua esigenza fotografica, Kiryu-san!"

msgctxt "10506"
msgid ""
"So, one of my boys told me about this beauty he's been eyeballing, girl "
"called the Judo Girl over on Tenkaichi Street in Kamurocho! Just look for a "
"broad in a school uniform and glasses, and that's your girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10715"
msgid ""
"Anyways, my friend was macking on her real hard, not taking no for an "
"answer... when suddenly she just picked him up and tossed him flat on his "
"ass! <Color:1><Sign:12><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10898"
msgid ""
"Man, I can picture it now! She's like some kinda wild beast behind those "
"bookworm glasses, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10999"
msgid "Bet she'd make a dang good shot if you ever find yourself up there!"
msgstr "Scommetto che verrebbe un bello scatto se ti trovassi lassù!"

msgctxt "11067"
msgid "Peace!"
msgstr "Pace!"

msgctxt "11074"
msgid "Mack in the House!<Color:1><Sign:16><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Mack in the House!<Color:1><Sign:16><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "11126"
msgid ""
"My Japanese is getting better with every breath I take of this sweet "
"Japanese air, Kiryu-san! Probably helps that I've been spending mad time "
"with my girl, too. I love her to pieces, lemme tell you, but she kiiinda "
"texts me way too much? <Color:1><Sign:10><Color:Default> Least I'm getting "
"lots of Japanese practice! <Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11477"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I saw these lovebirds over at the Kamurocho batting cages, and I got"
" this feeling the guy's gonna do something you don't wanna miss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11618"
msgid ""
"Btdubs you ever hear of dumb love? It's like, where you're so in love with "
"someone, you act like an idiot around them! That's what those two at the "
"batting cages are like! Me and my girl, too. "
"<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11844"
msgid "Nothing But Mack! <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Nient'altro che Mack! <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "11895"
msgid ""
"Heyo, Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default> Lemme cut to the chase: I"
" got another shot for you. <Color:1><Sign:47><Color:Default> There's this "
"rocking soba joint in the southeast part of Kamurocho, but the owner's "
"totally bonkers. <Color:1><Sign:35><Color:Default> Apparently his noodles "
"suffer for it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12205"
msgid ""
"Anyways, keep your eyeballs trained on that owner and your chance'll come in"
" no time flat! Probably when he hops on his bike, if I had to guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12350"
msgid "All Mack, All the Time!"
msgstr "Tutto Mack, tutto il tempo!"

msgctxt "12374"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! Hope you're swinging through the jungle of life like a monkey "
"hopped up on banana juice! Anyways, I just got word the bowling alley in "
"Kamurocho's a hotspot for weird shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12558"
msgid ""
"I dunno if there's a grain of truth to that, but you might wanna go take a "
"peek! <Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12673"
msgid ""
"Btdubs, I've been learning a ton of Japanese from this DVD I picked up the "
"other day. I had no idea you could use tentacles for THAT!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12807"
msgid "Mack in Motion! <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Mack in movimento! <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "12857"
msgid "Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "12901"
msgid ""
"There's this whiny little kid always begging his poor papa to buy him a toy "
"over on Park Boulevard, but his dad always shuts him down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13036"
msgid ""
"I thought they were tights on funds so I offered to buy something for the "
"little tyke, but his dad blew a gasket! Nearly punched my lights out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13180"
msgid ""
"I guess people don't like getting told how to parent! "
"<Color:1><Sign:11><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13268"
msgid ""
"Anyways, kids and Kamurocho are like oil and water! It's the perfect "
"contradiction that might just lead to the perfect shot! Peace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13400"
msgid "Crouching Tiger, Hidden Mack"
msgstr "La tigre e il Mack nascosto"

msgctxt "13429"
msgid "Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "13473"
msgid ""
"The perfect shot's practically staring me in the face these days, and I like"
" how it looks! Pretty sure I'm gonna beat you to the punch, haha! "
"<Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13648"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I heard this little tidbit and just had to share: Apparently there's"
" a ninja in Kamurocho handing out tissue packs on Nakamichi Street! It's "
"like we're extras in a real life samurai flick! Man, what I'd give to be on "
"the silver screen, see my name up in lights... I can just imagine it now. "
"Mack, Bigger, Better, and Badder!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13981"
msgid ""
"Well, good luck getting a shot of that ninja! Hope she's not too quick for "
"your shutter!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14070"
msgid "A Finely-Aged Mack <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Un Mack ben invecchiato <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "14123"
msgid ""
"Wassup, Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default> Word on the street is, "
"you've been busting heads left and right down in Okinawa! How do I know? I "
"just do, haha! Don't ask a man to share his secrets! "
"<Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14361"
msgid ""
"Btdubs, I've been peeping this yakuza series on TV lately, and it's off the "
"hook!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14443"
msgid ""
"But that's not what I wanted to tell you. Pal of mine down in Okinawa says "
"there's some asshole plastered out of his mind over in Hatsumachi! And lemme"
" tell you, not all drunks are created equal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14639"
msgid ""
"Turns out this guy isn't just any old boozer, he also knows some real badass"
" martial arts moves! What a combination, right!? Speaking of, you ever hear "
"of the movie Drinking Tiger? It's all about that kickass martial artist Wong"
" Fei Sung!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14878"
msgid ""
"Anyway, hop over to Hatsumachi and check this guy out when you get the time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14955"
msgid "IH Water Purifier"
msgstr "Depuratore d'acqua IH"

msgctxt "14973"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "Congratulazioni!"

msgctxt "14990"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've been selected to test our company's brand new Super "
"IH Water Purifier. Simply fill out a short survey for us, and the Super IH "
"Water Purifier is yours! Please visit us at the address below so we can tell"
" about our product and its installation procedure. Since this is our latest "
"and greatest model, supplies are limited to the first 30 customers who stop "
"by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15373"
msgid "IH Water Purifier, Inc."
msgstr "IH Water Purifier, Inc."

msgctxt "15397"
msgid "Park Blvd. Office, Kamurocho"
msgstr "Ufficio di Park Blvd., Kamurocho"

msgctxt "15426"
msgid "Casino boss"
msgstr "Boss del casinò"

msgctxt "15438"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "15449"
msgid "Temp"
msgstr "Temp"

msgctxt "15454"
msgid "Violence Tobita stopped by."
msgstr "Violence Tobita è passato a trovarci."

msgctxt "15482"
msgid ""
"Thank you. The thugs nearly pissed their pants when they saw Tobita. Still, "
"if they come back in numbers, I doubt even he could handle them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15623"
msgid ""
"There's a guy named Iwakuma at the stew shop on East Shichifuku Street. He's"
" training to be a sumo wrestler, but he's too wild to go pro. Still, his "
"wild side could make him a good bouncer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15813"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't mind going over to meet Iwakuma and seeing if he's bouncer "
"material, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15906"
msgid ""
"That Iwakuma is out of control. He actually picked a fight with Tobita when "
"he came to the Dragon Palace. Tobita's a cut above him, so it wasn't long "
"till he sent Iwakuma flying, but nevertheless, Iwakuma's pretty good "
"himself. Thank you so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16153"
msgid ""
"This homeless fellow who lives behind Millennium Tower told me something "
"interesting. It seems there's this former yakuza who left his family and "
"went into hiding. Since my enemy's enemy is my ally, I'd like for you to get"
" him to be my bouncer. In exchange, I'll guarantee his anonymity. "
"Supposedly, you can find him in an alley on Tenkaichi St."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16499"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't mind finding this former yakuza and seeing if he's bouncer "
"material, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16592"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for persuading Nanba-san to be my bouncer. When it comes "
"to yakuza, it takes one to know one. Thanks to Nanba-san, I can now get "
"things done with fewer fights. Win without fighting! That's the way to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16814"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, those thugs still haven't stopped harassing us here at the "
"casino. They've even started threatening us with stun guns and even real "
"guns. And the owner of the bikini bar over on Pink St., who happens to be an"
" old friend of mine, said they're being harassed by some kind of stalker. It"
" seems he's a hardcore weapons nut, so the owner's too scared to chase the "
"guy away. Now, if you could recruit him, we could kill two birds with one "
"stone. The bikini bar would be safe again, and my casino would get another "
"formidable bouncer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17357"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't mind going over to Pink St. and trying to recruit that weapons "
"freak for me, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17458"
msgid ""
"That weapons nut Hirano stopped by. He's been so busy tinkering with our "
"weapons here at the Dragon Palace that he's forgotten all about the girls at"
" the bikini bar, and the owner of the place is so thankful for our help. The"
" only problem is Hirano is collecting the strangest weapons you've ever "
"seen. We have no idea how to use them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17794"
msgid ""
"We're almost rid of those thugs thanks to all the bouncers you've recruited "
"for us. I think just one more would do the trick. And there just so happens "
"to be a guy I've had my eyes on. His name is Gatling Sendo. He was pro "
"boxer, but he got banned from competition because he was just too strong. If"
" the Dragon Palace could get him, you wouldn't have to recruit any more "
"bouncers for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18182"
msgid ""
"I hear he's been losing himself in booze and babes since he was banned. A "
"good place to start is MEB⑬you know, the place that provides info on "
"Kamurocho. Get him and your job's done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18367"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, Gatling Sendo came by. I was glad to see he's still as big and "
"strong as when he was pulverizing opponents in the ring. Looks to me like "
"he's been training as hard as ever. He even mentioned he wants to get back "
"into the ring someday. And since I'm an expert on forging IDs and creating "
"new identities, I think I might oblige him! Should be a piece of cake. "
"Besides, I'm a huge fan of Sendo's. I get chills up my spine just thinking "
"about seeing him pulverizing his opponents again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18861"
msgid ""
"Now that we have five bouncers, we should be able to deal with any thugs "
"that come our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18953"
msgid ""
"I'd like to thank you, so please stop by the casino when you have a moment. "
"Hope to see you soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19051"
msgid "Miyu Shiraboshi"
msgstr "Miyu Shiraboshi"

msgctxt "19067"
msgid "I'm back!"
msgstr "Rieccomi!"

msgctxt "19077"
msgid "Miyu here! <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Ciao! <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "19121"
msgid ""
"Just got back from Shizuoka! I'd sure like to see you. Stop by the club when"
" you have time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19213"
msgid "('-^*)/"
msgstr "('-^*)/"

msgctxt "19221"
msgid "Shiori Nagamori"
msgstr "Shiori Nagamori"

msgctxt "19237"
msgid "At work now<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Ora a lavoro<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "19281"
msgid "Hey Kiryu-san, Shiori here. <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Ehi Kiryu-san, sono Shiori. <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "19342"
msgid ""
"I'm at the club right now, so stop by if you're in the mood. "
"<Color:1><Sign:1><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19436"
msgid "I'll be waiting. <Color:1><Sign:16><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Ti aspetterò. <Color:1><Sign:16><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "19487"
msgid "Kana Momonogi"
msgstr "Kana Momonogi"

msgctxt "19501"
msgid "Going to work!"
msgstr "Vado a lavoro!"

msgctxt "19516"
msgid "Kana here! o(^-^)o"
msgstr "Sono Kana! o(^-^)o"

msgctxt "19535"
msgid "I'm gonna head to the club. Stop by if you've got time! See you later!"
msgstr "Sto andando al club. Passa a trovarmi se hai tempo! A dopo!"

msgctxt "19606"
msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Scusa!"

msgctxt "19613"
msgid "I'm really sorry... (；ω；)"
msgstr "Mi dispiace davvero... (；ω；)"

msgctxt "19644"
msgid "I didn't think you'd really come to see me... Sorry I wasn't there..."
msgstr "Non pensavo saresti venuto per davvero... Scusa se non c'ero..."

msgctxt "19714"
msgid "Hi!"
msgstr "Ciao!"

msgctxt "19718"
msgid ""
"Kana here. I had so much fun with you the other day. I'm going to the club "
"now... You should come see me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19824"
msgid "If you want to, I mean. (>∀<)"
msgstr "Se vuoi, intendo. (>∀<)"

msgctxt "19856"
msgid "Sorry again!"
msgstr "Scusa di nuovo!"

msgctxt "19869"
msgid ""
"I'm really sorry... I ended up not going into work today. Forgive me! （；＿；）"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19955"
msgid "I didn't mean to disappoint you, Kiryu-san... I'm the worst. (T_T)"
msgstr "Non volevo deluderti, Kiryu-san... Sono la peggiore. (T_T)"

msgctxt "20022"
msgid "Today's the day!"
msgstr "Oggi è il gran giorno!"

msgctxt "20039"
msgid ""
"Hi again! I promise I'll make it into work today. Please come by the club..."
" If you don't mind seeing me, I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20153"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "Grazie!"

msgctxt "20164"
msgid "Thanks for coming today! <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Grazie per essere venuto oggi! <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "20222"
msgid ""
"You're so fun to hang out with, Kiryu-san! I'm a big fan of yours. "
"<Color:1><Sign:1><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20322"
msgid "Please come again soon! ('-^*)/"
msgstr "Torna presto a trovarmi! ('-^*)/"

msgctxt "20354"
msgid "I owe ya! (/ω＼)"
msgstr "Ti devo un favore! (/ω＼)"

msgctxt "20373"
msgid "Thanks for asking for me tonight!<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Grazie per aver chiesto di me stasera!<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "20439"
msgid "You're such a great guy, Kiryu-san. <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Sei proprio un bravo ragazzo, Kiryu-san. <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "20508"
msgid "I hope we get to spend more time together soon."
msgstr "Spero passeremo più tempo insieme presto."

msgctxt "20556"
msgid "OMG! ∑ヾ(￣0￣; /"
msgstr "OMG! ∑ヾ(￣0￣; /"

msgctxt "20579"
msgid ""
"I just saw this really cute dress today.<Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20653"
msgid "It was absolutely gorgeous!<Color:1><Sign:26><Color:Default>"
msgstr "Era assolutamente stupendo!<Color:1><Sign:26><Color:Default>"

msgctxt "20714"
msgid ""
"But since it wasn't stretch fabric, I bet it won't fit. What kind of dresses"
" do you like, Kiryu-san? Knowing you, probably the sexy "
"kind.<Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20884"
msgid "BTW... (･ω･)b"
msgstr "Comunque... (･ω･)b"

msgctxt "20903"
msgid ""
"I'm not at the club at the moment. Where am I? It's a secret! Just kidding! "
"<Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21012"
msgid ""
"I'm out grabbing a bite with some girls from the club! Tell me about any "
"yummy restaurants you know about, okay? Later! "
"<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21165"
msgid "Shoulda seen it! Σ(･ω･/ ) /"
msgstr "Avresti dovuto vederlo! Σ(･ω･/ ) /"

msgctxt "21199"
msgid ""
"I just saw the cutest car! I couldn't believe my eyes. It was all "
"pink.<Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21303"
msgid ""
"I would give anything for a car like that! "
"<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default><Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default><Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21443"
msgid "Love you! ヽ(*・ω・)人(・ω・*)ノ"
msgstr "Ti amo! ヽ(*・ω・)人(・ω・*)ノ"

msgctxt "21485"
msgid "2d_cf_mail_momoka"
msgstr "2d_cf_mail_momoka"

