msgctxt "42871"
msgid "Congratulations, Kazuma, you've completed all the Substories."
msgstr "Congratulazioni, Kazuma, hai completato tutte le storie secondarie."

msgctxt "42933"
msgid ""
"You can't help but get involved in everything that happens around you, can "
"you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43013"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I have a gift for you. Bob Utsunomiya is holding on to it for you, "
"so go find him when you want to pick it up. He's somewhere around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43160"
msgid "Don't worry if you lose it. You can get it from him again."
msgstr "Non preoccuparti se lo perdi. Puoi riottenerlo da lui."

msgctxt "43219"
msgid "Hostess list complete"
msgstr "Lista hostess completata"

msgctxt "43241"
msgid "Congratulations! Looks like you've romanced all the hostesses."
msgstr "Congratulazioni! Sembra che tu abbia fatto breccia nel cuore di tutte le hostess."

msgctxt "43304"
msgid ""
"Bet you like all that attention, you playboy! Never would've pegged you for "
"a fan of hostess clubs, though... Anyway, I have a gift for you. Bob "
"Utsunomiya is holding on to it for you, so go find him when you want to pick"
" it up. He's somewhere around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43561"
msgid "Locker list complete"
msgstr "Lista armadietti completata"

msgctxt "43582"
msgid "Congratulations, Kazuma, you've opened all the coin lockers."
msgstr "Congratulazioni, Kazuma, hai aperto tutti gli armadietti a gettoni."

msgctxt "43643"
msgid ""
"You're surprisingly persistent. Anyway, I have a gift for you. Bob "
"Utsunomiya is holding on to it for you, so go find him when you want to pick"
" it up. He's somewhere around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "43822"
msgid "Food list complete"
msgstr "Lista cibo completata"

msgctxt "43841"
msgid "Congratulations, Kazuma, you've completed the food list."
msgstr "Congratulazioni, Kazuma, hai completato la lista del cibo."

msgctxt "43898"
msgid ""
"Watch your weight, though. You don't have that young man's metabolism "
"anymore. Anyway, I have a gift for you. Bob Utsunomiya is holding on to it "
"for you, so go find him when you want to pick it up. He's somewhere around "
"town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "44124"
msgid "Heat Action list complete"
msgstr "Lista azioni Heat completata"

msgctxt "44150"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, Kazuma, you've learned every Heat Action. Honestly, I'm not"
" surprised. Anyway, I have a gift for you. Bob Utsunomiya is holding on to "
"it for you, so go find him when you want to pick it up. He's somewhere "
"around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "44385"
msgid "Coliseum list complete"
msgstr "Lista Colosseo completata"

msgctxt "44408"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, Kazuma, you've defeated all the Coliseum opponents. Looks "
"like the Dragon of Dojima is still going strong. Anyway, I have a gift for "
"you. Bob Utsunomiya is holding on to it for you, so go find him when you "
"want to pick it up. He's somewhere around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "44679"
msgid "Modded weapons list complete"
msgstr "Lista armi modificate completata"

msgctxt "44708"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, Kazuma, you've obtained every modded weapon. Men love "
"modding their toys, I suppose. Anyway, I have a gift for you. Bob Utsunomiya"
" is holding on to it for you, so go find him when you want to pick it up. "
"He's somewhere around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "44957"
msgid "Revelations list complete"
msgstr "Lista rivelazioni completata"

msgctxt "44983"
msgid "I just heard the good news from my friend Bob Utsunomiya."
msgstr "Ho appena saputo la bella notizia dal mio amico Bob Utsunomiya."

msgctxt "45041"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, Kazuma, you've completed all the Revelations. And I must "
"say, the blog you created is very entertaining."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45163"
msgid "Minigame list complete"
msgstr "Lista minigiochi completata"

msgctxt "45186"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, Kazuma, you've completed all of the minigames. Never took "
"you for a gamer! Anyway, I have a gift for you. Bob Utsunomiya is holding on"
" to it for you, so go find him when you want to pick it up. He's somewhere "
"around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45425"
msgid "You gave Haruka everything she wants!"
msgstr "Hai dato ad Haruka tutto ciò che desidera!"

msgctxt "45463"
msgid "Renta Kamiyama"
msgstr "Renta Kamiyama"

msgctxt "45478"
msgid "Kamiyama Works Kamurocho"
msgstr "Kamiyama Works Kamurocho"

msgctxt "45503"
msgid "What's up, Kiryu-san? It's Kamiyama. We met in Okinawa."
msgstr "Come va, Kiryu-san? Sono Kamiyama. Ci siamo conosciuti a Okinawa."

msgctxt "45559"
msgid ""
"Just wanted to let you know my brother has a shop in Kamurocho. It's called "
"Kamiyama Works Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "45661"
msgid "Tell him I said hi if you ever stop by his shop."
msgstr "Salutamelo se mai passi dal suo negozio."

msgctxt "45710"
msgid "Later."
msgstr "A dopo."
